      "message": "[warning] Line 1126: 🟡 A previous Glide request can survive rebinding and overwrite a non-feed thumbnail later, because requests are only cleared conditionally in `onViewRecycled` and non-feed binds do not clear Glide state before `setImageBitmap`. This creates recycled-view races and wrong previews. Clear the target unconditionally when binding video items (and/or at recycle) with `Glide.with(imageView).clear(imageView)` before both feed and non-feed paths, then start the new load or set the bitmap.",
